  "answer": "Augustin is the Dean. In the events involving Sir Tristram and the Dean’s family, Augustin is the brother of Georgiana and the father of Salome and Sheba. He is the head of the Deanery household, and he is the one who is scandalized by Sir Tristram’s horse being brought into the Deanery stables, who is pressured by Georgiana to bet on the horse, and who is later accused of poisoning the horse and arrested by Noah. He is also the one who is referred to as 'the missing man' and whose return is awaited.",
